OL,3,GNEWSAHorse visits hospice to say final 
OL,4,Agoodbye                                
OL,6,FLaura Button, deputy director of       
OL,7,Fclinical services and ward manager,    
OL,8,Fsaid: "He was really poorly that day   
OL,9,Fand it took a little while for him to  
OL,10,Fregister that the horse was actually   
OL,11,Fhere.                                  
